# Raw Cyberpunk RED rulebook page text.
#
# These 452 files are a local reference for the discord-librarian agent only.
# They live at wiki/Local Archive/Rules/Rulebook/ on the VPS so the agent can
# read verbatim page text, but they must never be committed: the repo is public
# and publishing them would put the full rulebook online.
#
# They are also excluded from manifest.json by regenerate-wiki-manifest.py, so
# they do not appear in the site's file tree either. This entry is the backstop
# that makes an accidental `git add .` safe.
wiki/Local Archive/Rules/Rulebook/

# OpenClaw agent scaffolding - never site content
wiki/**/AGENTS.md
wiki/**/SOUL.md
wiki/**/TOOLS.md
wiki/**/USER.md
wiki/**/HEARTBEAT.md
wiki/**/IDENTITY.md
wiki/**/BOOTSTRAP.md
wiki/**/MEMORY.md

# Local repo metadata that the copy step can drag across
wiki/.openclaw/
wiki/.pi/
